<title>INDIA: CRISIL gives AAA (SO) to IRFC'S 5-bln-rupee bonds.</title>
<headline>CRISIL gives AAA (SO) to IRFC'S 5-bln-rupee bonds.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit Rating Information Services of India Ltd said on Wednesday it assigned a &quot;AAA(SO)&quot; rating to the Indian Railway Finance Corp's (IRFC) five-billion-rupee taxable bonds issue.</p>
<p>CRISIL said the rating indicated the highest safety with respect to the timely payment of interest and principal.</p>
<p>&quot;This rating takes into account the support mechanism from the Ministry of Railways for ensuring timely payment of obligations on the rated instrument,&quot; it added.</p>
<p>-- New Delhi newsroom +91-11 301 2024</p>
</text>
